WEBVTT

00:03.170 --> 00:04.250
Wide Heal!

00:09.970 --> 00:12.010
Thanks for saving us, Lady Schnee.

00:12.640 --> 00:16.560
The retreat was imminent
with only us on the ground.

00:16.560 --> 00:17.640
No.

00:17.640 --> 00:22.230
I could defeat it because
you fought to this point.

00:23.150 --> 00:25.780
We are honored by your words.

00:26.860 --> 00:30.530
The undead should not be able
to leave the Spirit Plains,

00:30.530 --> 00:32.780
but they've been escaping
over the past month.

00:33.660 --> 00:36.290
We have the elite forces
taking care of them.

00:36.830 --> 00:41.670
Yet she could defeat swiftly
what they couldn't.

00:41.670 --> 00:46.300
It's no wonder she's the one
serving beside a high human.

00:47.090 --> 00:51.550
Was that the last
of the reported irregular undead?

00:52.050 --> 00:54.930
Yes, Ma'am.
I hope it's indeed the last.

00:55.470 --> 00:58.480
I will continue the surveillance.

00:58.480 --> 01:02.550
If anything happens,
use the magic item I just gave you.

01:02.550 --> 01:03.440
Yes, Ma'am.

01:04.060 --> 01:05.400
Farewell.

01:10.280 --> 01:11.740
Master...

01:13.200 --> 01:16.080
I can finally meet you again, right?

01:17.870 --> 01:23.080
♪Pierce through the world That laugh at ideas♪

01:35.180 --> 01:39.770
♪We've arrived today carrying Something that is unnamed♪

01:39.810 --> 01:44.810
♪All of it cannot be Described by mere words♪

01:44.810 --> 01:48.780
♪We cannot accept that Tomorrow is the future♪

01:49.440 --> 01:53.530
♪For we do not have a way to Somehow put it into shape♪

01:53.530 --> 01:58.370
♪Gather the pieces of the broken heart♪

01:58.370 --> 02:02.870
♪And take back our voices♪

02:03.080 --> 02:06.540
♪Never let go of this hand you've grasped♪

02:06.540 --> 02:08.840
♪Because it's on the verge of disappearing♪

02:08.840 --> 02:12.630
♪Aah, please remain the way you are♪

02:12.630 --> 02:15.970
♪Even if the times is Accelerated by cruelty♪

02:15.970 --> 02:18.640
♪Even if your dream is disappearing♪

02:18.640 --> 02:21.970
♪Never give up the beat of your heart♪

02:21.970 --> 02:26.770
♪With the independence we've finally
Gained after falling many times♪

02:26.770 --> 02:31.990
♪Pierce through the world That laugh at ideas♪

02:53.450 --> 02:54.570
Will!

03:05.520 --> 03:06.900
Don't just stand there.

03:06.900 --> 03:08.730
Kill it, quick.

03:08.730 --> 03:10.190
Okay!

03:13.070 --> 03:14.150
Heal!

03:18.950 --> 03:21.150
- What is this?!
- Rashia!

03:21.150 --> 03:22.200
Don't worry.

03:22.200 --> 03:26.580
That's an effect for when you fulfill
a requirement to learn a new skill.

03:29.920 --> 03:31.340
- Hey, Rashia!
- Huh?!

03:32.000 --> 03:35.590
You look so dazzled.
Are you really okay?

03:35.590 --> 03:37.090
I am okay!

03:37.090 --> 03:41.350
Suddenly a way to use a skill
just got inside my head.

03:42.100 --> 03:45.600
Either way, the mission
to learn Purify is a success.

03:45.600 --> 03:46.910
Congrats!

03:46.910 --> 03:48.410
Good job.

03:49.310 --> 03:50.900
Thank you very much!

03:51.440 --> 03:53.860
Now we can do something
for the orphanage.

03:54.530 --> 03:57.860
After a bit of rest, let's get out
and go back to Bayrelicht.

03:57.860 --> 04:00.740
Yeah, no reason to stay longer.

04:02.830 --> 04:04.160
What's that sound?

04:05.540 --> 04:07.460
What the hell is that?

04:09.670 --> 04:12.170
You guys, what's wrong?

04:14.170 --> 04:15.880
What the hell is that?!

04:20.220 --> 04:21.760
It's beautiful.

04:21.760 --> 04:24.570
That's a magical essence
that moves the undead.

04:24.580 --> 04:25.690
Magical essence?

04:25.690 --> 04:26.930
Yeah.

04:26.930 --> 04:31.100
Monsters whose essences are absorbed
and can't keep their forms will disappear.

04:48.260 --> 04:49.710
(Monster, Skullface Lord)

04:49.710 --> 04:51.280
(Monster, Skullface Lord)
Level 804.

04:51.320 --> 04:54.210
What kinda monster is that...?

04:54.210 --> 04:55.550
No way.

04:55.550 --> 04:59.550
That monster may destroy
the kingdom.

05:00.300 --> 05:03.740
There's a barrier.
It's gonna be okay, right?

05:03.740 --> 05:04.810
Well...

05:05.560 --> 05:06.820
I wonder...

05:21.980 --> 05:24.780
Now that barrier is done for.

05:24.780 --> 05:28.040
Yeah, that one attack
must have smashed it.

05:30.500 --> 05:31.920
No way...

05:38.360 --> 05:40.710
Hey, it's looking at us.

05:40.710 --> 05:41.720
I guess so.

05:42.470 --> 05:43.800
Let's run!

05:48.390 --> 05:51.230
- So you're not letting us off?
- No, it's something else.

05:58.700 --> 06:01.110
Will! What should we do?!
Hey, Will!

06:01.110 --> 06:03.780
Calm down!
Panicking won't help at all!

06:03.780 --> 06:07.240
Hey, Shin!
Let's break through and escape!

06:07.240 --> 06:08.870
No, I'll stay.

06:08.870 --> 06:12.040
What?! What're you saying?
Do you want to die?!

06:13.080 --> 06:14.790
Limit off.

06:17.040 --> 06:20.420
With the barrier broken,
we can't let it roam free.

06:21.460 --> 06:25.220
Before there are more casualties,
I will finish it here.

06:25.220 --> 06:26.930
You two go back to the kingdom.

06:27.600 --> 06:30.930
This strength...
Who the hell are you?

06:31.640 --> 06:33.440
I'll leave Yuzuha and Rashia to you.

06:34.510 --> 06:37.940
You'd better explain it once
you're back, okay?

06:37.940 --> 06:38.940
Sure.

06:38.940 --> 06:43.940
I'm giving you a physical buff to make you
run faster, so don't trip, okay?

06:43.940 --> 06:45.450
Who're you talking to?

06:46.070 --> 06:49.030
Hey, that fox won't leave you alone.

06:49.030 --> 06:51.490
Ouchie! Hey, Yuzuha!

06:54.710 --> 06:57.210
Okay, I get it.
Don't stray away from me.

06:58.480 --> 07:00.550
That's settled then.

07:00.550 --> 07:02.960
Yeah. I'll give you an opening.

07:05.190 --> 07:06.720
Lightning Bunker!

07:09.220 --> 07:10.430
Go!

07:13.960 --> 07:15.100
And they are gone.

07:17.850 --> 07:19.360
Let's get the party started!

07:27.370 --> 07:30.040
Is that a Fox Fire? Good job, Yuzuha!

07:35.910 --> 07:38.620
If it keeps howling like that,
this won't end.

07:38.620 --> 07:41.210
Yuzuha, it'll get a little flashy.

07:41.210 --> 07:43.050
Hold on tight there!

07:44.170 --> 07:46.090
Hien! Raikiri!

07:55.570 --> 07:58.390
That kills loads of them, I bet.

07:59.350 --> 08:01.770
Oops, the map is all red!

08:02.440 --> 08:05.900
If only Schnee is here,
I can use other fighting methods.

08:06.650 --> 08:08.400
A blue marker?

08:08.400 --> 08:10.780
Blue means friend.

08:10.780 --> 08:11.990
No, wait...

08:11.990 --> 08:14.120
It's getting closer, which means...

08:15.320 --> 08:17.660
Yuzuha! We'll go around for a bit.

08:37.100 --> 08:39.400
How are you doing?

08:43.570 --> 08:45.070
Read the atmosphere, won't you?

08:47.650 --> 08:48.820
Yuzuha?

08:53.900 --> 08:56.240
A barrier, eh? Thanks, Yuzuha.

08:58.230 --> 08:59.410
Schnee...

09:04.810 --> 09:06.840
Schnee?

09:07.590 --> 09:10.220
Don't you have anything to say?

09:11.280 --> 09:12.810
Well...

09:12.810 --> 09:15.680
Sorry for leaving you for so long...

09:15.680 --> 09:16.720
Wrong.

09:18.140 --> 09:21.690
Thank you for keeping the shop...

09:21.690 --> 09:22.730
Wrong.

09:23.560 --> 09:26.230
It's not sorry nor thank you.

09:26.230 --> 09:27.610
What's next?

09:28.530 --> 09:30.030
(The Moon Sanctum)
What haven't I said yet?

09:31.110 --> 09:32.820
The words I should have said are...

09:35.510 --> 09:37.590
Ah, I see.

09:38.990 --> 09:40.780
I'm back.

09:40.780 --> 09:42.320
Welcome home.

09:47.430 --> 09:49.850
I really thought you wouldn't come back.

09:50.420 --> 09:51.510
I bet so.

09:52.720 --> 09:54.640
After we clear the death game,

09:54.640 --> 09:58.760
data like Moon Sanctum, Schnee,
and the others should've been deleted.

10:00.540 --> 10:01.670
Yuzuha.

10:02.270 --> 10:04.020
The barrier couldn't hold.

10:08.200 --> 10:12.660
I also have a lot to tell,
but let's do that after we settle this.

10:13.160 --> 10:14.110
Agreed.

10:14.110 --> 10:16.870
I want to unleash a big one,
how about it?

10:16.870 --> 10:18.280
It sounds good.

10:18.280 --> 10:20.540
We have just the right one for it.

10:23.740 --> 10:24.920
Here we go.

10:26.490 --> 10:28.930
Here's a team move
after a very long while.

10:28.930 --> 10:29.920
Indeed.

10:30.720 --> 10:33.670
Oh, those who are pure,
reveal yourself!

10:34.360 --> 10:37.180
Oh, those who are everlasting,
reveal yourself!

10:37.660 --> 10:38.930
- Sanctuary!
- Sanctuary!

11:16.720 --> 11:17.800
Master!

11:18.260 --> 11:18.970
Wait!

11:20.470 --> 11:23.890
That power...

11:26.600 --> 11:27.730
That thing

11:28.520 --> 11:30.160
talked?

11:30.160 --> 11:31.230
Master!

11:32.050 --> 11:33.610
Are you all right?

11:33.610 --> 11:35.860
Yes, I'm okay. No problem.

11:37.450 --> 11:39.870
In the end, we figured out nothing.

11:39.870 --> 11:43.490
That enemy seemed like it could
give us some clue though.

11:44.150 --> 11:46.870
- It seems to be over.
- It appears so.

11:47.830 --> 11:51.710
This place will turn normal again soon.

11:51.710 --> 11:53.130
We finally met.

11:53.880 --> 11:55.880
So why don't we have a chat?

11:57.650 --> 11:58.590
Sure.

12:00.800 --> 12:05.310
Do you remember the time
everyone sent me off to fight Origin?

12:05.310 --> 12:06.390
Yes.

12:06.390 --> 12:09.650
I defeated Origin then
and it was over.

12:09.650 --> 12:11.060
Or so it was supposed to be.

12:11.690 --> 12:14.940
(Play guide, Config, Logout)
There was a big door in the boss's dungeon room

12:14.940 --> 12:17.110
and after I won, it opened.

12:18.120 --> 12:20.530
A door, you said?

12:20.530 --> 12:23.580
Yeah. My conscience stopped there.

12:23.580 --> 12:25.700
When I came to, I was in a meadow.

12:25.700 --> 12:29.250
That's why it's not like I went
somewhere for 500 years.

12:29.250 --> 12:31.990
Is that so?

12:31.990 --> 12:33.070
Schnee?

12:34.810 --> 12:36.420
Please don't mind me.

12:37.340 --> 12:40.680
The dungeon disappeared without a trace.

12:40.680 --> 12:43.680
After that, other players' support
characters made a commotion

12:43.680 --> 12:46.270
since their masters had disappeared,

12:46.270 --> 12:49.690
thus I knew that you had
cleared the dungeon.

12:49.690 --> 12:54.110
I found it strange how we still exist
when we should have disappeared too,

12:54.110 --> 12:56.440
so we went to search for our masters.

12:57.440 --> 12:59.990
However, due to the land crust upheaval,

12:59.990 --> 13:02.820
the continent was
in a state of confusion.

13:02.820 --> 13:06.330
So everyone went their own ways.

13:06.330 --> 13:10.080
So I returned to the Moon Sanctum
and here I am now.

13:11.210 --> 13:14.340
So it matches what I had learned.

13:14.340 --> 13:17.090
Do you have anything on
your mind, Master?

13:17.090 --> 13:19.220
Nah, it's nothing.

13:19.840 --> 13:22.430
By the way, Schnee...

13:23.220 --> 13:26.930
Can you stop calling me Master?

13:26.930 --> 13:30.180
What's wrong with calling you "Master"?

13:30.850 --> 13:36.980
Someone famous like you calling me
master in public will surely cause a stir.

13:38.440 --> 13:40.740
But then, how should I call you?

13:41.280 --> 13:44.240
Huh? Just call me by name.

13:44.240 --> 13:45.490
That's just...

13:46.700 --> 13:48.240
What's wrong, Schnee?

13:49.330 --> 13:51.000
Then I shall...

13:52.290 --> 13:54.250
Shin.

13:54.250 --> 13:56.250
Yes.

13:56.250 --> 13:58.560
What an impact!

13:58.560 --> 13:59.500
Pardon?

13:59.500 --> 14:02.510
Nothing, really. It's nothing!

14:02.510 --> 14:05.760
Anyway, please call me
Shin from now on.

14:05.760 --> 14:08.760
I will do so, Shin.

14:09.670 --> 14:10.590
Yeah!

14:11.640 --> 14:14.940
What will you do from now on, Shin?

14:16.520 --> 14:19.440
First, I want to go to
the Holy Land which I found

14:19.440 --> 14:21.780
while investigating the Kingdom's library.

14:21.780 --> 14:24.820
- Have you been there?
- Yes.

14:24.820 --> 14:27.990
However, I only did a quick
search around the area,

14:27.990 --> 14:31.000
so I don't know what the inner area is like.

14:31.000 --> 14:32.040
I see.

14:32.800 --> 14:35.680
I guess I should go there myself.

14:36.250 --> 14:37.840
If...

14:37.840 --> 14:39.540
If you find the way,

14:41.000 --> 14:42.920
will you be going home?

14:47.530 --> 14:48.610
Yeah.

14:52.360 --> 14:54.360
I see.

14:55.570 --> 14:56.730
Of course, you will.

14:57.480 --> 14:59.770
- Sorry.
- Don't be.

14:59.770 --> 15:01.820
I figured so from the start.

15:03.260 --> 15:04.820
Hey, Schnee.

15:05.450 --> 15:09.580
How much do you remember
when this world was a game?

15:10.020 --> 15:10.950
Everything.

15:11.400 --> 15:12.450
Everything?

15:13.960 --> 15:16.960
Since the time I appeared
in that land together by your side.

15:18.780 --> 15:19.960
I remember it all.

15:21.170 --> 15:23.210
You can't make me forget it.

15:25.120 --> 15:26.470
I won't ask you to.

15:27.830 --> 15:30.050
I start to have a certain consciousness

15:30.050 --> 15:32.850
since you and the others
call it a death game.

15:33.560 --> 15:36.980
Everything before that
felt like watching a movie.

15:36.980 --> 15:40.060
It's like looking at myself from above.

15:41.230 --> 15:42.480
I see.

15:43.320 --> 15:46.490
This means, you knew
that you would also disappear,

15:46.490 --> 15:49.490
after all of us logged out.

15:50.240 --> 15:54.500
If I think about what
you were feeling at that time...

15:55.120 --> 15:58.790
If I say anything,
you'd be burdened by it, right?

15:58.790 --> 16:01.610
That time it was the best option to take.

16:01.610 --> 16:02.630
True.

16:03.520 --> 16:08.130
At that time, we were not
entirely able to act freely,

16:08.130 --> 16:10.470
so in the end,
it was just not possible.

16:10.970 --> 16:14.010
Even then, if you tell us
you have a sense of self,

16:14.010 --> 16:16.310
we'd think of other ways and such.

16:16.310 --> 16:19.640
You really have a troublesome personality.

16:19.640 --> 16:21.400
Shut up, leave that be.

16:22.320 --> 16:23.150
But...

16:24.190 --> 16:28.450
You'd go to fight
despite knowing that.

16:28.450 --> 16:29.780
Well, true.

16:29.780 --> 16:33.200
Moreover, you've made a promise.

16:37.050 --> 16:38.140
Yes.

16:45.780 --> 16:49.720
Now, now. Let's leave
the gloomy talk behind.

16:49.720 --> 16:51.640
We have finally met after all.

16:51.640 --> 16:52.680
You're right!

16:52.680 --> 16:54.800
Let's feast at the Moon Sanctum
once we're back!

16:54.800 --> 16:56.770
Let's do so.

16:56.770 --> 17:00.570
Before that, I would like
to ask you one thing.

17:03.480 --> 17:05.980
What is that over there?

17:05.980 --> 17:07.440
Oh, right.

17:07.440 --> 17:10.070
Things happened and I made
a partner contract with it.

17:10.070 --> 17:12.070
Its name is Yuzuha.

17:12.070 --> 17:14.530
Just between us, it's an Elementail.

17:14.530 --> 17:16.290
Elementail?

17:16.290 --> 17:19.830
Just by seeing its tails, I thought
it was a common fox spirit.

17:19.830 --> 17:21.870
You can tell from its tail?

17:21.870 --> 17:24.840
You didn't notice it?

17:29.850 --> 17:31.840
It has three tails now.

17:33.940 --> 17:35.220
Morning, Shin.

17:35.220 --> 17:37.970
What?! Hold up, Yuzuha!

17:37.970 --> 17:40.100
You can speak now?

17:41.060 --> 17:45.360
Somehow after that black thing is gone,
my head becomes clear.

17:45.360 --> 17:46.480
The black thing?

17:47.480 --> 17:51.570
Oh, right, Skullfaces surrounded
the shrine back then.

17:51.570 --> 17:55.200
I can assume the Lord
just now is their chief.

17:55.200 --> 17:58.150
Anyway, you mustn't talk
in front of people.

17:59.450 --> 18:01.580
Normal spirit doesn't talk!

18:03.000 --> 18:05.630
Then can I talk inside your head?

18:05.630 --> 18:08.090
Telepathy? That's fine.

18:08.090 --> 18:13.720
But, Shin, it has more than one tail,
so you can't hide it as a little fox.

18:13.720 --> 18:16.810
Yuzuha, can you make it a single tail?

18:16.810 --> 18:17.970
Easy peasy!

18:20.720 --> 18:23.730
- Wow!
- That's amazing.

18:24.520 --> 18:26.810
Can you remain like this in public?

18:26.810 --> 18:28.770
Sure, I can do that.

18:28.780 --> 18:30.480
That's settled quickly.

18:30.480 --> 18:32.320
Am I being a good kid?

18:32.320 --> 18:34.240
You are, and I'm so proud!

18:36.400 --> 18:37.490
She's so cute.

18:37.490 --> 18:38.780
Hmm?

18:39.640 --> 18:41.490
Nothing.

18:42.340 --> 18:44.870
- Do you want to pet her?
- Please!

18:46.080 --> 18:50.130
That aside, you sure always
amaze me, Shin.

18:50.630 --> 18:51.550
Hmm?

18:51.550 --> 18:56.640
It was said that no one
has ever tamed an Elementail.

18:56.640 --> 18:58.970
Yet you didn't look so surprised.

18:58.970 --> 19:02.770
Well, I was surprised,
but I think it isn't impossible for you.

19:03.640 --> 19:07.360
It also isn't the high-level ones
like we fought last time.

19:07.360 --> 19:10.780
It's so hard to weaken it
while holding back.

19:11.390 --> 19:13.970
It's normally a monster that you
should be careful of.

19:17.450 --> 19:19.870
- It's about time we go.
- Indeed.

19:19.870 --> 19:22.660
Oh, right, I let my companions
go before me.

19:22.660 --> 19:26.040
Then let's hurry.
We might still catch up to them.

19:26.040 --> 19:28.960
You're right.
Let's go as fast as possible.

19:28.960 --> 19:31.130
It'd be a hassle
if they reported to the guild.

19:31.130 --> 19:35.370
You could've told me first
and postponed our talk.

19:38.130 --> 19:41.510
How could I not talk right away
after seeing that face?

19:42.310 --> 19:44.640
This and that are a different issue.

19:46.770 --> 19:48.940
- All right, let's go.
- Yes.

19:55.070 --> 19:58.650
Hey, Will. Is Mr. Shin all right?

19:58.660 --> 20:02.200
Don't worry.
You know how strong he is.

20:02.200 --> 20:03.290
But!

20:04.540 --> 20:05.910
Something is coming!

20:05.910 --> 20:07.580
That's an unbelievable speed!

20:07.580 --> 20:08.920
- Will!
- Get back!

20:09.420 --> 20:11.790
Did that monster come after us?!

20:12.670 --> 20:15.550
It's too fast! Let's battle it here!

20:21.250 --> 20:22.810
Hey, Wilhelm.

20:24.060 --> 20:26.110
We caught up with you, somehow.

20:27.130 --> 20:28.590
Anything wrong?

20:29.810 --> 20:33.820
Stop being so misleading!

20:37.320 --> 20:39.110
Look at that ground!

20:39.110 --> 20:41.410
What had happened here?

20:41.740 --> 20:43.700
Do you find anything?

20:43.700 --> 20:46.870
No, forgive us, Princess Rionne.

20:46.870 --> 20:48.040
I see.

20:49.080 --> 20:53.420
A massive number of Skullfaces
appeared after a mysterious voice.

20:53.420 --> 20:56.760
And then came a light
that covered the sky.

20:56.760 --> 21:01.180
The Skullfaces turned into dust
and we were healed.

21:01.760 --> 21:03.470
Who did that?

21:04.470 --> 21:06.680
Pardon my intrusion,

21:06.680 --> 21:09.430
but can you look at this?

21:10.020 --> 21:10.980
What is this?

21:10.980 --> 21:13.940
I found it at the end of the rift over there.

21:13.940 --> 21:18.690
It was stabbed at the end of it,
so it must be the cause.

21:19.320 --> 21:22.280
I don't know what skill it is used for.

21:22.280 --> 21:23.530
I see.

21:23.530 --> 21:24.910
But there's one thing.

21:24.910 --> 21:27.830
Can you see what's on
this part of the sword?

21:27.830 --> 21:30.580
Is that some kind of bird?

21:31.080 --> 21:34.000
Indeed. I assume it's a falcon.

21:34.000 --> 21:37.610
I have an idea who would
carve these on swords.

21:37.610 --> 21:38.840
Please look at this.

21:40.670 --> 21:41.930
I see.

21:41.930 --> 21:45.850
Despite being battered and almost broken,
it still holds so much power.

21:45.850 --> 21:50.930
A blacksmith who can make a sword
this strong and carve a falcon insignia...

21:50.930 --> 21:53.600
As far as I know,
only one person is possible.

21:53.600 --> 21:55.860
I see. And who is it?

21:55.860 --> 21:57.360
A high human.

21:58.400 --> 22:04.070
And one distinguished among others
in blacksmithing, the Ebon Blacksmith!

22:16.380 --> 22:23.130
♪In the midst of the journey of
Neverending dreams♪

22:23.130 --> 22:28.510
♪I tried peeking
Through the yet-unseen future♪

22:28.510 --> 22:35.100
♪Whether the thing that lies
There is the smile of my friends♪

22:35.100 --> 22:41.230
♪Or is it despair and fury,
I've yet to know♪

22:41.230 --> 22:47.120
♪No matter how passionately
I wished for it♪

22:47.120 --> 22:52.370
♪I cannot return to the past♪

22:53.040 --> 22:58.710
♪So I will at least this hand mine now♪

22:58.710 --> 23:02.550
♪To build through the future♪

23:04.670 --> 23:10.720
♪In the lands so far away that
I will one day reach♪

23:10.720 --> 23:16.560
♪I'm sure there will be many
Great happiness waiting♪

23:16.560 --> 23:22.650
♪For all the smiles that always
Overflows this heart of mine♪

23:22.650 --> 23:28.370
♪I wish to protect them all,
So I aimed to the skies♪

23:28.370 --> 23:34.160
♪And build over an unwavering path♪

23:35.040 --> 23:40.000
(Next time, Episode 5:
One Moment of Rest)
